---
import LocaleLayout from '~/components/layout/LocaleLayout.astro';
import research from '~/data/research.json';
import media from '~/data/media.json';
import entityMedia from '~/data/entity-media.json';
import articleCovers from '~/data/article-covers.json';
import { getUi } from '~/i18n/ui';
const ui=getUi('en');
const coverSources=[...new Map(articleCovers.map(c=>[c.sourcePage,{url:c.sourcePage,title:c.sourceTitle}])).values()];
---
<LocaleLayout locale="en" title={ui.frontier.aboutLabel} description="Sources, editorial standards, current coverage and artwork credits for the independent Frosthaven digital wiki.">
 <article class="prose dark:prose-invert mx-auto" data-pagefind-body><h1>{ui.frontier.aboutLabel}</h1><p>{research.editorialPolicy}</p><h2>What has been researched?</h2><p>The site includes seventeen class introductions and seventeen role-based build frameworks. The scenario, item, enemy and building references are currently partial. They are not a complete export of the digital Codex.</p><h2>What still needs verification?</h2><ul>{research.coverageGaps.map(g=><li>{g}</li>)}</ul><h2>How are corrections handled?</h2><p>Report a specific page, the current game version and the conflicting tooltip or official source through <a href="https://github.com/tielidev/frosthaven-wiki/issues">the repository issue tracker</a>. Personal account information and game saves should not be included in public reports.</p><h2>Primary sources and supporting references</h2><ul>{research.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.url}>{s.title}</a><p>{s.scope}</p></li>)}</ul><h2>Artwork and animation credits</h2><p>Frosthaven, its characters and visual assets belong to their respective rights holders, including Cephalofair Games, Snapshot Games, Arc Games and relevant licensors. Official promotional screenshots, character art and looping media are used to illustrate the game. Public availability is not an assertion of an open asset license or official endorsement.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.playfrosthaven.com/en/media">official media library</a>, <a href="https://www.playfrosthaven.com/en">official character showcase</a> and <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2347080/Frosthaven/">Steam store</a>.</p><ul>{media.map(m=><li><a href={m.url}>{m.name}</a> — {m.width} × {m.height}</li>)}</ul><h2>Official monster spotlight images</h2><ul>{entityMedia.map(m=><li><a href={m.url}>{m.name}</a></li>)}</ul><h2>Article cover sources</h2><p>Each article has an individually selected cover. Gameplay scenes and development artwork are illustrative; they do not establish a class identity, exact build, or current mechanic. The same cover is used on article cards, the article itself and sharing metadata.</p><ul>{coverSources.map(c=><li><a href={c.url}>{c.title}</a></li>)}</ul><h2>Website software</h2><p>Based on <a href="https://github.com/PNGTRID/AnvilWiki">AnvilWiki</a>, distributed under its MIT license. This software license does not grant rights to game artwork.</p></article>
</LocaleLayout>
